      "text": "解：每个小球受三个力：重力$\\vec{G}$，细线的弹性力$\\vec{F}_{\\text{弹}}$和库仑力$F=\\frac{q^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2}$(图108).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 150,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0159#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "解：每个小球受三个力：重力$\\vec{G}$，细线的弹性力$\\vec{F}_{\\text{弹}}$和库仑力$F=\\frac{q^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2}$(图108).",
      "changes": [],
