      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$F_2=F_{21}+F_{23}=\\frac{|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{r_{12}^2}+\\frac{|q_3|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$F_2\\approx14.0\\times10^{-6}$牛顿.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$F_2\\approx14.0\\times10^{-6}$牛顿.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "第三个物体所受的两个力，方向相反(图109). 第一个物体给它的吸引力$F_{31}$大于第二个物体给它的排斥力$F_{32}$. 合力的大小等于两个力的差. 合力的方向指向大的力：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "第三个物体所受的两个力，方向相反(图109). 第一个物体给它的吸引力$F_{31}$大于第二个物体给它的排斥力$F_{32}$. 合力的大小等于两个力的差. 合力的方向指向大的力：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$F_3=F_{31}-F_{32}=\\frac{|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{(r_{12}+r_{23})^2}-\\frac{|q_2|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 152,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0161#8"
      ],
