  "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1",
  "edition": "modern-us-neutral-en",
  "status": "draft",
  "source": {
    "path": "lessons/phy9-c2-s2-n64/lesson.json",
    "sha256": "65d4306a4109af5cb793a05fcb708279b1ddf5708ac77d8dbf8934eb999359ee",
    "data": {
      "id": "phy9-c2-s2-n64",
      "card_id": "phy9-c2-s2-n64",
      "chapter": "第二编 电动力学基础",
      "section": "第八章 静电学",
      "number": "64",
      "title": "在均匀电介质内部静电荷的相互作用",
      "printed_title": "64. 在均匀电介质内部静电荷的相互作用",
      "start_page": 158,
      "start_printed": 149,
      "figures": [
        {
          "id": "fig-108",
          "label": "图 108",
          "page": 159
        },
        {
          "id": "fig-109",
          "label": "图 109",
          "page": 160
        }
      ],
      "exercise_count": 0,
      "prose": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "带电体之间的相互作用力，不同于万有引力，与它们所处的介质的性质有关. 设带电小球是放在均匀的绝缘体中，或者说放在电介质中. 此时，电介质应当是流体(煤油、油等).因为固体中产生弹性力，所以测量固体电介质内部带电体的相互作用力是不可能的.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "正如实验所指出的，在均匀电介质中电荷间的相互作用力，永远小于在真空中的. 同时，在真空中电荷相互作用力$F_0$跟在电介质中相距同样距离的这些电荷相互作用力$F$的比值，既与电量无关，也与它们之间的距离无关. 这个比值只由电介质的性质来确定. 如果用$\\varepsilon$表示这个比值，则",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\frac{F_0}{F}=\\varepsilon$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得出，在国际单位制中，电介质中的电荷相互作用的库仑定律为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F=\\frac{1}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\cdot\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{r^2}$，　(8-9)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在CGSE单位制中",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "量$\\varepsilon$叫做**电介质的介电常数**.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**电介质的介电常数是表征物质电性质的物理量，是表明真空中电荷的相互作用力比电介质中它们相互作用力大多少倍的物理量**. 它是一个不变的量. 对于真空来说，$\\varepsilon=1$. 以后我们再说明电介质中电荷相互作用力小于真空中的原因.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在书末附表中，列举了一些物质介电常数的数值.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 149,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0158#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**例　题**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "1. 在质量$m=0.03$克的水滴中有多少电子？水分子的质量$m_0\\approx3\\times10^{-23}$克.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解：水分子H$_2$O包含有10 个电子：2 个氢原子有2 个电子，1 个氧原子有8 个电子. 在水滴中包含有$\\frac{m}{m_0}=10^{21}$个分子，从而有$10^{22}$个电子.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "2. 假如在真空中相距1 千米的两个点电荷，各带1 库仑的电量，试求它们之间的排斥力是多大？",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解：根据公式(8-2)和(8-8)，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F=k\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{r^2}=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2}$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F=9000$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "3. 两个相同的小球分别用长$l=2$米的细线悬挂于一点. 当两个小球带有相等的电量$q=2\\times10^{-8}$库仑时，它们的距离为$r=16$厘米. 试求每根细线的张力？",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解：每个小球受三个力：重力$\\vec{G}$，细线的弹性力$\\vec{F}_{\\text{弹}}$和库仑力$F=\\frac{q^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2}$(图108).",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "小球静止不动，因此，库仑力$F$与细线的弹性力的水平分量相平衡：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-108",
          "label": "图 108",
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图108",
          "id": null,
          "label": "图 108",
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F-F_{\\text{弹}}\\sin\\alpha=0$.因为$\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{r}{2l}$，所以$F_{\\text{弹}}=\\frac{F}{\\sin\\alpha}=\\frac{F\\cdot2l}{r}=\\frac{q^2\\cdot2l}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3}$，$F_{\\text{弹}}\\approx3.5\\times10^{-3}$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 150,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0159#13",
            "p0160#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**细线的张力约**等于$3.5\\times10^{-3}$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "4. 三个不大的带电体放在均匀电介质中的一条直线上，介电常数$\\varepsilon=2.1$. 带电量$q_2=1.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体，放在带电量$q_1=-3.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体(距离$r_{12}=0.4$米)和带电量$q_3=5.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体(距离$r_{23}=0.6$米)之间. 试求每个物体所受库仑力的合力.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**解：**根据库仑定律，第一个和第二个物体的相互吸引力为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_{12}=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r_{12}^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "第二个和第三个物体相互排斥力为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_{23}=\\frac{|q_2|\\cdot|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r_{23}^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "第一个和第三个物体相互吸引力为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_{13}=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon(r_{12}+r_{23})^2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "现在我们讨论第一个物体所受的两个库仑力(图109).它们是同方向的. 因此，合力的大小等于它们大小的和：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#10",
            "p0161#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-109",
          "label": "图 109",
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图109",
          "id": null,
          "label": "图 109",
          "printed_page": 151,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0160#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_1=F_{12}+F_{13}=\\frac{|q_1|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_2|}{r_{12}^2}+\\frac{|q_3|}{r_{13}^2}\\right)$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_1\\approx14.5\\times10^{-6}$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "第二个物体所受的两个库仑力，也是同方向的(图109)，因此，合力的大小为：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_2=F_{21}+F_{23}=\\frac{|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{r_{12}^2}+\\frac{|q_3|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_2\\approx14.0\\times10^{-6}$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "第三个物体所受的两个力，方向相反(图109). 第一个物体给它的吸引力$F_{31}$大于第二个物体给它的排斥力$F_{32}$. 合力的大小等于两个力的差. 合力的方向指向大的力：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_3=F_{31}-F_{32}=\\frac{|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{(r_{12}+r_{23})^2}-\\frac{|q_2|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$F_3\\approx0.5\\times10^{-6}$牛顿.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 152,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0161#9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
